#: df379493acbd4f3cad341c019e980597
msgid "Reboot dom0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/3_2.rst:95
#: 8eb4d8c9a99d4707b3f1646de8c92b96
msgid ""
"Please note that if you use :doc:`Anti Evil Maid </user/security-in-qubes/"
"anti-evil-maid>`, it won’t be able to unseal the passphrase the first time "
"the system boots after performing this in-place upgrade procedure since the "
"Xen, kernel, and initramfs binaries will have changed. Once the system boots "
"up again, you can reseal your Anti Evil Maid passphrase to the new "
"configuration. Please consult the Anti Evil Maid :doc:`documentation </user/"
"security-in-qubes/anti-evil-maid>` for instructions on how to do that."
msgstr ""

